1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,100
This jellyfish can live forever.

2
00:00:02,589 --> 00:00:04,879
When it gets old or hurt, it doesn't die.

3
00:00:05,379 --> 00:00:09,000
It melts into a tiny blob, sinks to the sea floor,

4
00:00:09,099 --> 00:00:10,580
And turns back into a baby.

5
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:15,199
Its old cells become brand new ones, and it grows up all over again.

6
00:00:15,599 --> 00:00:17,260
Again, and again, and again.

7
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:19,100
So unless something eats it,
